{"id": "85988", "name": "אינטגרל של x^(−1/n) – חזקה שלילית שברית (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Integrate \\({{CT:0}}^{{CT:1}}\\) with respect to {{CT:2}}.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">The power rule</b><br>This problem can be solved using the rule for integration<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int x^n dx = \\frac{1}{n+1}x^{n+1}+c \\]</p>where \\(c\\) is a constant of integration.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int {{CT:3}} d{{CT:0}} &= \\left[\\frac{1}{{{CT:1}}+1}\\right]x^{{{CT:1}}+1}+c \\\\ &= \\left[\\frac{1}{\\left({{CT:4}}\\right)}\\right]x^{{CT:4}}+c \\\\ &= {{CT:5}}+c \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 1